mremoteng (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First beta release of mRemoteNG for Linux, an unofficial port of
    mRemoteNG: connection files shared with Windows mRemoteNG 1.77 and
    later; SSH, Telnet, raw TCP and local terminal sessions; SFTP and
    FTP/FTPS file transfer; a look that follows mRemoteNG for Windows.

